83	     * ({@code NSW 2000-2099}, {@code VIC 3000-3099}, {@code QLD 4000-4099}), that region is returned.
84	     * Otherwise the region is looked up from the fixed city-to-region table
85	     * ({@code Sydney->NSW}, {@code Melbourne->VIC}, {@code Brisbane->QLD}), yielding {@code 'UNKNOWN'}
